WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.879
Ricky: I ran home as fast as I could.

2
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.891
Rachel: I just got home too.

3
00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:20.473
Dad: Our city is looking great.

4
00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:26.744
Ricky: Do we need more cars, Dad?

5
00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:29.815
Dad: You're home early, honey.

6
00:00:29.816 --> 00:00:37.100
Mom: I wanted to work on our city.

7
00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:42.858
Ricky: Look! This is me wearing a scary mask.

8
00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:49.233
Mom: Oh, Ricky, did you know the computers are fixed?

9
00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.617
Ricky: Oh, I didn't know.

10
00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:59.636
Dad: You can use them if you want.

11
00:00:59.637 --> 00:01:04.289
Ricky: No thanks. This is more fun.

12
00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:09.878
Rachel: Here, Ricky, I made this for you.

13
00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:14.142
Dad: Our city looks really good.

14
00:01:14.143 --> 00:01:17.151
Mom: Yes, that's great.

15
00:01:17.152 --> 00:01:20.769
Ricky: We make a good team.

16
00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:35.421
Ricky: Spending time with family is the most fun.

